scn 1
# explore-move-2048 (perf follow-up D, timing only): unit-dependent exploration on a map-sized plane. A flat
# 2048x2048 map (exploration plane 1024x1024 cells), nothing explored, and two armies of 500 marching into
# unexplored ground, so every tick some footprints change cell and reveal: SIMPHASE explore= is that reveal
# work plus, until D, a rebuild of the block summaries from the whole plane every tick.
# Run with tools/scenarios/perf-explore/run.sh or wall.sh (base vs candidate on the timing cores).
name explore-move-2048
ticks 600
seed 7
players 2
weapons off
explored none
map flat 2048 2048
type r roster
group A 0 r 500 rect 40 40 140 240
group B 1 r 500 rect 1900 1800 2000 2000
at 1 move A 1000 1000
at 1 move B 1100 1100
